IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `uc-core`
IMPORT `uc-core-bodies`

-- The Universal Credit Regulations 2013 (S.I. 2013/376), piece uc2: the nouns and the one helper that more than one of my
-- modules reads. Source: ../../registers/source-bundle/uksi-2013-376.txt, a plain-text rendering made by a converter script; it is not the official text.
-- Target: the stable build 1.6.98. Units: money is a NUMBER of pounds (338.58); a fraction has 1 as the whole; a percentage is
-- written with the % literal.
--
-- WHAT IS HERE: "enactment" is used by regulation 83(2)(b) and by paragraphs 17(1)(b) and 18(2) of Schedule 10. Regulation 2
-- (the keel's `reg 2 — enactment`) says only that the word INCLUDES two things, so it can say yes and never says no. The helper
-- below asks whether a provision is an enactment: yes if it is one apart from regulation 2 (a stated input), or if regulation 2
-- includes it.

-- reg 2 "enactment" (keel): includes an enactment comprised in, or an instrument made under, an Act of the Scottish Parliament
-- or the National Assembly of Wales. A provision outside those two is an enactment or not apart from regulation 2; that is a
-- stated input, because regulation 2 does not say.
DECLARE `Provision whose standing as an enactment is asked by uc2` HAS
    `enactment comprised in an Act of the Scottish Parliament or the National Assembly of Wales`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `instrument made under an Act of the Scottish Parliament or the National Assembly of Wales`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `an enactment apart from the inclusions in regulation 2`                                      IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN provision IS A `Provision whose standing as an enactment is asked by uc2`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`uc2 helper — a provision is an enactment` provision MEANS
        (provision's `an enactment apart from the inclusions in regulation 2`)
    OR  (`reg 2 — enactment` (`Provision whose standing as an enactment is asked` WITH
            `enactment comprised in an Act of the Scottish Parliament or the National Assembly of Wales` IS provision's `enactment comprised in an Act of the Scottish Parliament or the National Assembly of Wales`
            `instrument made under an Act of the Scottish Parliament or the National Assembly of Wales` IS provision's `instrument made under an Act of the Scottish Parliament or the National Assembly of Wales`)
         EQUALS `included by the definition of enactment`)
